# Python / uv
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# Secrets / local config
# The class, not the instances. `.env` and `.env.gateway` were listed by name,
# so `.env.sops` — added later — was untracked but not ignored, one `git add -A`
# away from being published in a public repo. It is sops-encrypted, which is the
# only reason that was a near miss rather than an incident.
.env*
!.env.example
web/.env*
!web/.env.example
web/node_modules/

# Local vector store + ingested data
/data/
*.sqlite3

# OS
.DS_Store

# Service logs (sb-web-api under launchd) — may echo request details
logs/
# Internal deployment planning — superseded by the shipped implementation,
# and deliberately not published (it maps the lab that serves the demo).
docs/web-ui-scope.md

# Agent working files and internal planning notes. These describe the lab and
# the deployment, which is exactly what this public repo must not carry — the
# same rule that keeps the deployment note out of the demo's corpus.
.claude/
.codex/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
CODEX_*.md
HANDOFF_REPORT.md
